          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most homes, the Frost King FC1 is the best outdoor faucet cover: a simple foam dome with a gasket that seals against the wall. Choose the Zoblise or Frost King FC2 where a spigot gets knocked, the Biggun for easier fitting, and the Hedoc Pro, ArtiGifts Pro or Duck soft covers for faucets a rigid dome cannot fit.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
